# One sweep across two TTL schemas leaves by deadline, then entry
# ([LDET.5.11], [LDTL.6.1]). Host asserts. Slow (`ttl 3_s`) is loaded before
# Fast (`ttl 1_s`). Slow 1 enters at 0, deadline 3 s; Fast 2 enters at 1.5 s,
# deadline 2.5 s. The sweep at 3 s expires Fast 2, then Slow 1, where load or
# entry order would give Slow 1 first. Default TTL mode: the sweep merges the
# per-schema FIFOs.
#
# The trace prints `retract` with no identity, so the recordings cross-read,
# which compares the FactWithdraw records' fact ids, pins the order.
# @spec [LDET.5.11]
assert Slow id=1
pump
advance 1500000000
assert Fast id=2
pump
advance 1500000000
pump
